sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as User
  participant B as Browser/Platform
  participant A as Authenticator
  participant RP as Relying Party

  RP->>B: create() options (challenge, rpId, params)
  B->>A: CTAP2 makeCredential
  A-->>B: attestationObject, publicKey
  B-->>RP: clientDataJSON + attestationObject
  RP-->>RP: Verify attestation, store public key
